wing with blue LED strips and spotlights over a dark patio at night\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-blue-led-strips-night-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Louvered roof glowing with blue LED strips and spotlights over a dark patio at night\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-island-slat-front-led-lighting-night-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Outdoor kitchen island with slatted front and warm LED strip under blue ceiling lights at dusk.\"><img src=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-island-slat-front-led-lighting-night-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Outdoor kitchen island with slatted front and warm LED strip under blue ceiling lights at dusk.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-bar-blue-led-lighting-night-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Outdoor kitchen bar lit with blue LED lighting at night under a louvered roof with a fire pit.\"><img src=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-bar-blue-led-lighting-night-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Outdoor kitchen bar lit with blue LED lighting at night under a louvered roof with a fire pit.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-red-led-lighting-dusk-patio-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White louvered roof lit with red LED lights over a travertine patio with wicker seating at dusk\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-red-led-lighting-dusk-patio-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"White louvered roof lit with red LED lights over a travertine patio with wicker seating at dusk\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-blue-led-lighting-dusk-patio-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"White louvered roof lit with blue LED lights over a travertine patio with wicker seating at dusk\"}]</script></section><div><section class=\"mm-que mm-que--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Smart Soffit &amp; LED Lighting Systems for Florida Homes</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We install smart soffit and LED lighting systems in North &amp; South Florida, boosting curb appeal, security, and energy efficiency.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Custom Runs &amp; Concealed Channels</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We mount the LED run tight to the soffit line in aluminum channel finished to match your fascia, so the diodes stay out of sight and only the light shows. Crews pull low-voltage wire inside the soffit, seal every penetration against water, and mount the transformer where you can reach it.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Soffit LED Installation</dt><dd>South &amp; North Florida contractors install custom soffit LED lighting for residential homes.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Low‑Profile LED Channel Installation</dt><dd>Custom installers conceal wiring in color‑matched aluminum channels for a sleek residential finish.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Sealed Housings &amp; LED Retrofits</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Salt air and UV break down open fixtures, so we install IP68-rated channel and stainless fasteners anchored into framing rather than bare soffit panel, which is what holds a run together in coastal Florida wind. Retrofits pull aging halogen strands and put LED diodes on a low-voltage circuit.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Weather‑Resistant Soffit Lighting</dt><dd>Builders fit durable, weatherproof soffit LED systems to protect against Florida storms.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Energy‑Efficient Soffit LED Upgrades</dt><dd>South Florida installers retrofit existing soffit lighting with energy‑efficient LED technology.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Controllers, Zones &amp; RGBW Color</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Each node on the track carries its own RGBW diode, so one run gives you warm white for a regular night and full color when you want it. The controller mounts by the panel and talks to your phone, and we split the run into zones that follow the elevations of the house.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Smartphone‑Controlled Lighting Setup</dt><dd>Contractors integrate smart controllers so homeowners adjust soffit lighting via phone apps.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Color &amp; Pattern LED Systems</dt><dd>Builders install LED systems offering millions of colors and patterns for personalized illumination.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Security Lighting &amp; Holiday Color</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Soffit LEDs wash the walls, entry, and driveway, which removes the dark corners a camera cannot resolve and keeps light off your neighbor's windows. The same permanent track carries holiday color, so nobody is on a ladder in December stapling strands to the fascia.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Security Accent Lighting Contractors</dt><dd>Renovation pros install soffit LEDs that improve nighttime security around Florida homes.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Permanent Holiday Lighting Installers</dt><dd>Installers mount programmable soffit LEDs that give Florida homeowners year‑round holiday colors.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our LED Lighting Install <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our team designs, wires, and installs Gemstone Lights smart soffit LED systems across North and South Florida, meeting all local electrical codes.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/suelta/modern-patio-cover-woodgrain-ceiling-lights-night-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"Black-framed patio cover with woodgrain ceiling, recessed lights and fan at night over a travertine patio\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Planning &amp; Selection\"></div></figure><ol class=\"mm-pasos\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/suelta/modern-patio-cover-woodgrain-ceiling-lights-night-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"Black-framed patio cover with woodgrain ceiling, recessed lights and fan at night over a travertine patio\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Planning &amp; Selection</h3><p>Contract execution, project documentation, and selection of lighting fixtures to match the design and client preferences.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/suelta/large-patio-cover-recessed-lighting-night-pavers-florida-proceso1.avif\" alt=\"Large dark-framed insulated patio cover with rows of recessed lights glowing at night over a paver court\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Smart Lighting System Design &amp; Integration</h3><p>Design of lighting zones using Gemstone Lights IP68-rated fixtures. Integration with smart home systems for automated scheduling, color adjustments, and scene creation for entertaining.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-050/louvered-roof-closed-louvers-underside-detail-florida-proceso2.avif\" alt=\"Underside of a white louvered roof with louvers closed, wall lights on the left.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Electrical Work &amp; Permitting</h3><p>Electrical plan development for wiring routes, power supply adequacy, and any required permits. Installation of electrical infrastructure supporting all lighting zones.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-033/louvered-roof-blue-led-night-outdoor-lounge-florida-proceso3.avif\" alt=\"Outdoor lounge and dining set under a louvered roof washed in blue LED light at night\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Installation &amp; Smart Automation Setup</h3><p>Professional installation of all fixtures, wiring, controllers, and smart home integration. Testing of all lighting zones, app setup for remote control, and automated scheduling configuration.</p></li></ol></div></section>";
const T6 = "<section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc3\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>Soffit LED Lighting FAQs</h2><div>Have questions about smart soffit and LED lighting in Florida? Our Gemstone Lights-certified specialists answer your top questions from Florida homeowners.</div></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Why choose LED soffit lighting for Florida homes?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">LED soffit lighting improves curb appeal, security, and energy efficiency with smart color and brightness controls. As a certified Gemstone Lights dealer, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living installs IP68-rated systems engineered for Florida's coastal humidity and salt-air conditions.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Is smart outdoor lighting energy efficient?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. LED lighting uses up to 80% less energy and lasts significantly longer than traditional bulbs, lowering long-term costs across your Florida property. Smart scheduling and dimming features give you full control over your home's exterior lighting from a smartphone app.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can I customize smart lighting colors and zones remotely?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Smart LED soffit systems allow full control of individual lighting zones, colors, and brightness levels directly from a smartphone app. You can set holiday color themes, event scenes, or scheduled timers — all managed remotely without any technical expertise required by Florida homeowners.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Does exterior LED lighting improve home security?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Well-placed exterior LED soffit lighting deters trespassers by eliminating dark zones around your home's perimeter. Motion-sensitive smart scheduling enhances visibility for security cameras and creates the impression of occupancy — providing Florida homeowners with passive, energy-efficient protection around the clock.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Is professional installation required for these systems?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">For safety, warranty, and code compliance, professional installation by our certified Gemstone Lights team is strongly recommended. Improper wiring risks voiding manufacturer warranties and violating Florida electrical codes. Our licensed technicians ensure every IP68-rated fixture is correctly grounded and sealed against coastal moisture and heat.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section><section class=\"testimonial-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"74852c7c-aeb3-35a7-5cf1-44f4ce6ecae5\" class=\"header-reviews\"><div class=\"label\">TESTIMONIALS</div><h2 class=\"white\">What Our Clients Say About Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><p>Hear from Florida homeowners who appreciate the enhanced security, architectural beauty, and energy savings from our smart soffit LED systems.</p></div>";
